    "everreal_2": {
      "type": "basic-content-helper-text-centered-full-width",
      "settings": {
        "kicker": "Our promise",
        "title": "The characters bring the excitement. We bring the clarity.",
        "body": "<p>A first cosplay starts with a character you love—and quickly becomes a list of questions. Does the cape come with it? Which size should you choose? Is the wig in the photograph part of the set? EVERREAL is built around making those answers easier to find.</p><p>Our idea is simple: bring the costume, the finishing pieces and the practical guidance together. Browse a world, see the complete contents, then decide how you want to make the look your own. The excitement belongs to you. The details belong on the page.</p>",
        "alignment": "center",
        "max_width": "wide",
        "title_size": "xl",
        "title_weight": "bold",
        "kicker_size": "sm",
        "surface": "none",
        "use_custom_colors": true,
        "bg_color": "#FFFFFF",
        "text_color": "#202039",
        "muted_text_color": "#514E6E",
        "accent_color": "#7047BD"
      }
    },
